GAL16V8
BRIDGE30
; Bridge card U3 (ATF16V8B), rev 3.0: Model I strobes -> ECB MREQ*/IORQ*/RD*/WR*/M1*/RESET*.
MRD_N MWR_N IN_N OUT_N INTAK_N SYSRES_N NC NC NC GND
NC MREQ_N IORQ_N RD_N WR_N M1_N RESET_N NC NC VCC

/MREQ_N  = /MRD_N + /MWR_N
/IORQ_N  = /IN_N + /OUT_N + /INTAK_N
/RD_N    = /MRD_N + /IN_N
/WR_N    = /MWR_N + /OUT_N
/M1_N    = /INTAK_N
/RESET_N = /SYSRES_N

DESCRIPTION
ECB bridge card for the TRS-80 Model I. Source of truth: ecb_bridge_card.pld.
